[["heading","FULL-STACK SOFTWARE ENGINEERING INTERNSHIP"],["heading","SECTION 22 / 34\nMongoDB &\nNoSQL"],["heading","Complete Visual Teaching Edition"],["sinhala","","සරල සිංහල + English explanations, MongoDB queries, Mongoose examples සහ interview",459],["text","practice."],["heading","18"],["heading","Original concepts\n25"],["heading","Additional concepts\n43"],["text","Visual lessons"],["heading","What is MongoDB?"],["text","MongoDB is a document database. It stores data as BSON documents in collections, and supports\nqueries, aggregation, indexes and transactions."],["sinhala","","MongoDB කියන්Jන් documents මඟින් data සංවිධානය කරන database එකක්. MERN application",481],["sinhala","","එකක backend එක හරහා Jමේ database එකට data save සහ retrieve කරනවා.",397],["text","React UI\nExpress API\nMongoDB driver /"],["text","Mongoose\nMongoDB"],["heading","How to use this guide"],["text","Read each definition, trace the diagram, type the example into a disposable test database, then\nanswer the interview question without notes. Original topics follow the master checklist; lessons 19–\n22 retain the compact guide additions, and 23–43 expand the interview syllabus."],["text","Examples are independent educational snippets, not a single script. Shell examples use mongosh; Mongoose and\ndriver examples assume an initialized connection and named models/collections where indicated. Outputs are\nexpected results, not executed test results."]]